{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the boots of <strong>John Builder</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elon Fusk\u2019s</strong> construction bots went crazy, and you, a tired worker, are the last line of defense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swing your fists through metal, bricks, and stone to defend what\u2019s left of the job site and maybe humanity. Crack skulls, punch robots, sip coffee. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s just another day on the world\u2019s most dangerous construction site. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now get back to work! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chaotic physics based movement and combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different enemies and bosses to beat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wide range of unlockable skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Silly characters </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672440?t=1746082401","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672440?t=1746082401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/b4f7c75b1c4e158d1ea97f58e55d61a0afa23ca8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746082401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/b4f7c75b1c4e158d1ea97f58e55d61a0afa23ca8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746082401","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the boots of <strong>John Builder</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragra